b4agent
Copyright the b4agent authors.

b4agent bundles third-party skills and prompts. Each keeps its license file
next to it; vendor.json and each skill's UPSTREAM.md record the source,
pinned commit and local changes. Files adapted from these works were
modified by the b4agent authors (2026), as noted in their headers.

